- track spacing = w minus a fixed overlap by implement class (tillage/seeding 5-10 cm; combine header overlap 10-30 cm);
- terrain compensation (roll compensation c of 0.95-0.98);
- active implement steering (implement drift reduced by a factor);
- section control at headlands for sprayers.
Run each under the GNSS tiers derived from CORS/RTKLIB.
